WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,040
Work and personal relationships must also be distinguished

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,680
Since the boss treats you so well

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,040
You have to work hard

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,400
Never let anyone down

5
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,560
Of course

6
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,080
Last time, in preparation for Tianbao hand shooting

7
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:10,400
I didn't say anything for three whole days

8
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:11,520
Afraid of making any disclosures

9
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:13,200
As a result, the auction was a success

10
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,360
The boss is very satisfied

11
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:15,760
He even praised me in public

12
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:16,960
That's good

13
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:19,560
Now he has become the boss behind the Hong Kong Hotel

14
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:22,240
I was also asked to be responsible for employee rights and operational supervision.

15
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:24,280
The annual salary will be directly raised to two million for me.

16
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:25,800
That 0.5% share

17
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,520
Also stay in my hand completely

18
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,640
From now on, you can get big dividends every year

19
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,000
All our family’s worries

20
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,120
Everything was resolved by him casually

21
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:34,880
All this was given by Zhang Tong

22
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:38,190
I don't even know how to repay others.

23
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:39,670
Leave it to me to repay the boss.

24
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:41,230
Mom, you don’t have to worry so much

25
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:42,630
How do you plan to repay

26
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:44,390
Trying to make money for the auction house

27
00:00:44,390 --> 00:00:46,350
I usually take good care of him.

28
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:47,630
In fact, in the boss’s view

29
00:00:47,630 --> 00:00:49,510
It’s really just a little effort to help our family.

30
00:00:49,510 --> 00:00:51,430
It didn’t take any effort at all. It’s so old.
